                      (    forth6809.asm):08667         ; "99 TO TESTWD" directly (TO parses "TESTWD" via WORD+FIND,
                      (    forth6809.asm):08668         ; needing LATEST still pointed at it - not restored until this
                      (    forth6809.asm):08669         ; whole test finishes, unlike every earlier test in this
                      (    forth6809.asm):08670         ; section), executes TESTWD again (expect 99). Explicitly forces
                      (    forth6809.asm):08671         ; STATE=0 (interpreting) before calling TO, since its own
                      (    forth6809.asm):08672         ; behavior genuinely differs by STATE (confirmed by reading its
                      (    forth6809.asm):08673         ; code: TOIMMED's direct store path only runs when STATE=0) -
                      (    forth6809.asm):08674         ; not left to chance.
