                      (    forth6809.asm):09684         ; TSTTICK1 - unit test for ' (tick), found case. Builds a fake
                      (    forth6809.asm):09685         ; header pointing at DUP's own CFA, redirects LATEST to it and
                      (    forth6809.asm):09686         ; SRCADDR to a matching fake name, and verifies TICK returns the
                      (    forth6809.asm):09687         ; correct xt. Redirects CODEHERE too, even though TICK doesn't
                      (    forth6809.asm):09688         ; itself compile anything - WORD's own internal parse still
                      (    forth6809.asm):09689         ; writes through it regardless (the same real bug found via MAME
                      (    forth6809.asm):09690         ; earlier applies to any word that calls WORD, not just the
                      (    forth6809.asm):09691         ; defining words that originally surfaced it).
