                      (    forth6809.asm):12020         
                      (    forth6809.asm):12021         ; FIND had no dictionary entry at all - confirmed by checking for
                      (    forth6809.asm):12022         ; any H_FIND label or FCC "FIND" string anywhere in this file
                      (    forth6809.asm):12023         ; before adding this. Its actual implementation (verified before
