                      (    forth6809.asm):13249                  ; that point - confirmed nothing else in this routine, including
                      (    forth6809.asm):13250                  ; NUMLOOP/UDMULADD, ever touches CADDR) rather than remembered
                      (    forth6809.asm):13251                  ; in a new persistent flag here - GLOBALS is fully packed at
                      (    forth6809.asm):13252                  ; 256/256 bytes, and this avoids needing to carve out a byte
                      (    forth6809.asm):13253                  ; for it.
