                      (    forth6809.asm):16996                                      ; set, so "false by omission" wasn't the
                      (    forth6809.asm):16997                                      ; right default). Investigated by tracing
                      (    forth6809.asm):16998                                      ; DIVCOMMON (shared by /, MOD, /MOD)
                      (    forth6809.asm):16999                                      ; against this system's own SM/REM and
                      (    forth6809.asm):17000                                      ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):17001                                      ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):17002                                      ; dividend's own original sign) after
                      (    forth6809.asm):17003                                      ; dividing absolute values - exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):17004                                      ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):17005                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):17006                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):17007                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):17008                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
                      (    forth6809.asm):17009                                      ; quotient would be negative with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):17010                                      ; nonzero remainder) that DIVCOMMON does
                      (    forth6809.asm):17011                                      ; not have. This system's primary
                      (    forth6809.asm):17012                                      ; division words (/, MOD, /MOD) use
                      (    forth6809.asm):17013                                      ; symmetric division, not floored -
                      (    forth6809.asm):17014                                      ; FLOORED is 0 (false), a real, meaningful
                      (    forth6809.asm):17015                                      ; answer (recognized query, value false),
                      (    forth6809.asm):17016                                      ; not the "unrecognized" fallthrough
                      (    forth6809.asm):17017                                      ; WORDLISTS correctly uses.
FD8B FDD9000800FF     (    forth6809.asm):17018                  FDB   EN10,EN10L,255  ; NEW: MAX-CHAR - maximum value of any
                      (    forth6809.asm):17019                                      ; character in this implementation's
                      (    forth6809.asm):17020                                      ; character set (3.2.6). This system uses
                      (    forth6809.asm):17021                                      ; 8-bit characters throughout (matching
                      (    forth6809.asm):17022                                      ; ADDRESS-UNIT-BITS=8, already in this
                      (    forth6809.asm):17023                                      ; table) - a single byte's maximum value
                      (    forth6809.asm):17024                                      ; is 255.
