                      (    forth6809.asm):17026                                      ; CELLS - computed from this system's own
                      (    forth6809.asm):17027                                      ; stack region boundaries rather than
                      (    forth6809.asm):17028                                      ; hardcoded, so this stays correct if the
                      (    forth6809.asm):17029                                      ; memory map shifts again (it has
                      (    forth6809.asm):17030                                      ; repeatedly this session). RSTACK's own
                      (    forth6809.asm):17031                                      ; comment confirms the occupied range is
                      (    forth6809.asm):17032                                      ; $BD00-RSTACK (768 bytes currently) -
